# summary: the idea dump: ideas kept until a unit picks one up or the human drops one; list, get, add, pick, drop, and search, never delete
# version: 1.0.0
# description:
# The ideas module is the workspace's own idea module: each idea is one record of its
# ideas container, the fields declared by its data file and every write checked by the
# storage layer's field validator. An idea is added OPEN, then picked by a unit or
# dropped with a reason, and never deleted: the module has no delete verb, and its
# pairings (picked_by only with PICKED, reason only with DROPPED) are its own rules.
